	// #100: THE MANIFEST IS THE PAYLOAD. It names the tagged release's
	// toplevel store path; `nanokvm-update` substitutes that closure from our
	// signed binary cache, fetching only what this device does not already
	// have. So nothing is downloaded, hashed or untarred here -- the three
	// steps that used to stand between getLatest() and install() are gone, and
	// with them the 460 MB tarball they moved (pkgs/nanokvm-server.nix step 3b).
	_ = sendMessage("install", 0)
	err = install("", latest.Version)
